In MSTest v4, the `out` parameter overload of `Assert.IsInstanceOfType<T>` was removed. The fix is to use the non-out version for the assertion, then cast separately:

```csharp
// Before (MSTest v3):
Assert.IsInstanceOfType<FastProcessor>(processor, out var typed);

// After (MSTest v4):
Assert.IsInstanceOfType<FastProcessor>(processor);
var typed = (FastProcessor)processor;
```

